Hi all,

Although it wasn't made public on www.kernel.org yet (I can't get why),
Linux 2.6.1-rc1 has been released today. It includes all i2c patches
that had been pending for up to three months.

I invite everyone using 2.6.0 to could give it a try. Also, this should
become our base version for future patches.

